# entropy: the entropy service. The role of Debian's rng-tools.
#
# Milestone 611 (every program and crate belongs to a package). The package's name, kind, home
# and membership are provisional, the lane's proposal for calef to ratify; the format is
# helpers/packages.py's header, and notes/package-boundaries.md has the table and the reasons.

name entropy
kind base
home entropy provisional

program entropy
